delity and realism.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518430/extras/f14a6341396ff14e36246bf72e58755f.poster.avif?t=1695404425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518430/extras/f14a6341396ff14e36246bf72e58755f.webm?t=1695404425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518430/extras/f14a6341396ff14e36246bf72e58755f.mp4?t=1695404425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>",
